  "day": {
    "about": "The dormitory by morning, whole (D126): Gemini 3 Pro Image, given the whole night painting as it is, painted it again a few hours later from tools/art/prompts/game-dormitory-day.md (game-dormitory-day, its first try), the same things in the same places, the morning sky above the walls and in every window, the outside by day, the rooms lit by day and every torch, candle and the fireplace out. tools/art/trace.py fit laid it on the painting box by box: every static thing's and door's box within three pixels (one to three right, none down), the share of the night's dark outlines it covers 0.56 to 0.78, below the plan's 0.85 because the night's outlines are thickened by its shadows and the neighbouring dormitory is nearly black, and 0.845 to 0.96 with a pixel's tolerance but for the front wall (0.69, that dormitory's dark in its box); the owner chose the whole picture on 2026-11-01. tools/art/repaint.py join lays it whole by its outlines (`whole`) into the scene's picture by morning (`sources` `hours`), which every image of the scene is cut from a second time.",
